//! The console key `rom`, the default: the kernel writes no UART register
//! and the console stays at the 115200 the mask ROM left.
//!
//! One of the `s3console` modules, mapped by a case's `console` (the runner)
//! or an image's `[keys]` (`sosimage`). The HAL's `clock_init` calls its
//! `console_init` first (`../../kernel/lib.saw`; `../../ABI.md` §14i).

/// Set the console's rate this image is built for: the ROM's, so nothing is
/// written.
public func console_init() unsafe { }
